--
--This is identical to Perl's builtin C<rmdir()> function
--for removing (empty) directories, see L<perlfunc/rmdir>.
--
--=item scanf
--
--scanf() is C-specific, use E<lt>E<gt> and regular expressions instead,
--see L<perlre>.
